ios: never open IndexedDB (local cache)

The client cached jag archives and OnDemand files in IndexedDB. In the iOS app every file is
already local (jag archives in the bundle, OnDemand files from the bundled main_file_cache via the
LocalOnDemand override), and in WKWebView the IndexedDB path made startup ~10x slower (29.5 s vs
2.85 s to "Preparing game engine"). db = null also skips the map/model prefetch passes.
Low detail now unloads unused models after a map build even without a db, because LocalOnDemand
can always re-read them (upstream only did so when a db could restore them).

